OL,3,GNEWSAExemptions removed as hosepipe ban
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water (SEW) is to implement
OL,7,Ffurther hosepipe restrictions for its
OL,8,Fcustomers across Sussex.
OL,10,FFrom Friday, in order to "protect water
OL,11,Fsupplies and the environment", it is
OL,12,Fremoving previous exemptions to the
OL,13,Ftemporary ban which came into place
OL,14,Fthis summer.
OL,16,FThis includes those on SEW's Priority
OL,17,FServices Register, such as the blind or
OL,18,Fthose with chronic or serious illness -
OL,19,Falthough an exemption remains in cases
OL,20,Fof unavoidable health and safety
OL,21,Freasons and where the welfare of
OL,22,Fanimals is paramount.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
