OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAExemptions removed as hosepipe ban
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FSEW has also applied for a ban on all
OL,7,Fnon-essential "commercial and
OL,8,Fnon-household" water usage (NEUB),
OL,9,Fblaming what it called the "prolonged
OL,10,Fperiod of warm and dry weather" earlier
OL,11,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
